            "notes": "Now the build really starts picking up. We take [Discord Fever](item_f6bede6a-a54c-4133-b171-78b5a282681f) to help punish anyone low or anyone you have trouble hitting like Pharah or Junkrat. Now that we're at our minimum of 30% movement speed (45% every time [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) triggers,) it's going to be a lot easier for us to pressure the enemy team anywhere they aren't looking.\n\nIf you find yourself flush with cash, go ahead and take  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) , trading out  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for it.",
